'''Buffalos''' are farm animals found on the [[Ortus Farm]], alongside [[chicken]]s and [[alpaca]]s.

As part of the bovidae family, they are Varlamore's equivalent of a [[cow]] from the mainland, and will count towards a cow slayer task. Giving or feeding a buffalo something it doesn't like will result in a chat message saying, {{Mes|The buffalo doesn't want that.}} One [[dairy buffalo]] can also be found on the farm; attempting to milk a regular buffalo with a bucket results in the message {{mes|Only dairy buffalo are suitable for milking.}}

Killing a specific buffalo on a specific day of the week while wearing [[Nettles#Gloves|gloves that protect you from nettles]] can result in the buffalo dropping a [[Token (Varlamore)|token]], accompanied by the chat message {{mes|The buffalo drops a small token.}} See [[Token (Varlamore)]] for more information.

